# Copy to .env and fill in from Supabase → Project Settings → API.
# Vite only exposes VITE_-prefixed vars to the browser.
#
# The anon key is PUBLIC by design — it ships in the JS bundle and anyone can
# read it. That is fine and expected: Row Level Security is what protects your
# data, not the key.
#
# ⚠️ NOTHING ELSE BELONGS IN THIS FILE.
# The service_role key and ESPN cookies are NOT here on purpose. They live in
# Supabase, and only the sync-espn Edge Function ever touches them:
#   - SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_ANON_KEY / SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY are injected
#     into Edge Functions automatically. You do not set them anywhere.
#   - ESPN cookies are entered by the commissioner in the app's League Settings
#     and stored write-only in the database.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
